{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>女星王丹妮與丈夫羅孝勇結婚3年以來長期分隔香港及澳洲兩地，沒想到今日卻突然無預警向大眾報喜宣布「3+1=4」。這段經歷無數遠距離考驗與難關異地婚姻，如今終於迎來令人意想不到且徹底改變二人生活軌跡震撼結局。</p>\n<h2>王丹妮羅孝勇結婚三周年高調曬超聲波照宣布造人成功</h2>\n<p>11月25日正好是王丹妮與羅孝勇在澳洲舉辦婚禮三周年紀念日，兩夫妻選擇在這個極具紀念價值日子於社交平台分享手持BB超聲波相片。相中可見二人笑容滿面地準備迎接家庭新成員，更感性寫下「關於愛的所有想像，在這一刻又有了新的形狀。謝謝你如期而至，點亮我們的三周年。」等字句。這個首度孕育愛情結晶品及升格為四口之家震撼消息，瞬間在網絡上瘋傳並成為全城熱話。</p>\n<h2>王丹妮感謝各界體諒承諾兼顧幕前工作與孕期健康</h2>\n<p>面對懷孕喜訊曝光後如雪片般飛來外界祝福，王丹妮親自發聲回應並衷心感謝電影公司及各大客戶體諒與支持。她透過聲明強調未來日子會好好享受這段迎接新生命時光，並盡量保持身心健康狀態。同時她亦向粉絲派定心丸，承諾會把手頭上所有工作繼續努力做好，未來將以一個截然不同面貌與身分繼續與大家見面，絕對不會因為大肚而全面停工休息。</p>\n<h2>羅孝勇年底脊醫畢業結束長年異地戀一家四口將團聚</h2>\n<p>羅孝勇與王丹妮這段婚姻其實充滿著各種挑戰，近年男方遠赴澳洲攻讀脊醫課程，女方則獨自留港拍戲打拼，兩人聚少離多只能靠抽空探望維繫感情。幸好羅孝勇即將於今年年底正式完成學業畢業，加上太太懷孕可謂雙喜臨門。而王丹妮本身育有一名女兒，繼父羅孝勇一直視如己出且關係親密，如今大女亦非常興奮準備升格做家姐，一家人年底終於可以結束異地生活正式大團圓。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入社交平台留言狂賀大讚異地戀修成正果極感人</h2>\n<p>喜訊一出隨即引爆大批網民熱烈討論，不少粉絲紛紛湧入社交平台留言送上最真摯祝福。有網民激動表示「恭喜晒Louise同Sheldon！異地戀真係唔容易，見到你哋咁幸福好感動」，亦有人留言大讚「大女一定會係個好家姐，期待BB出世」、「年底畢業加做老豆真係人生大贏家」。大眾普遍對於這對夫妻能夠克服遠距離戀愛並迎來新生命感到無比欣慰，整個網絡充滿著一片歡樂與溫馨氣氛。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557652888980933_11061533066b0652d15862e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557652888980933_11061533066b0652d15862e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557653815344387_19068425056b0652da7c56b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557653815344387_19068425056b0652da7c56b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557654059241104_2485565536b0652dda68cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557654059241104_2485565536b0652dda68cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557654499122207_5986989736b0652e1a4a28.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557654499122207_5986989736b0652e1a4a28.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>未婚懷孕後分手成單親媽 羅孝勇用愛呵護</h2>\n<p>24歲時，王丹妮意外懷孕，誕下女兒Affa，回流香港。後來她與男朋友性格不合，一度因為想給女兒一個完整家庭而考慮是否分手，但最後還是決定分開，成為單親媽媽。為了湊大女兒，她努力做模特兒工作，賺錢養家。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/ec8e7e2e-7e67-4a50-8823-a949c9b2b836_15116909206195ebeab3e43-839x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/ec8e7e2e-7e67-4a50-8823-a949c9b2b836_15116909206195ebeab3e43-839x1024.jpg\" width=\"839\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/81b833db-fced-449d-ab87-8b011f1af625_9357912576195ff4389258-705x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/81b833db-fced-449d-ab87-8b011f1af625_9357912576195ff4389258-705x1024.jpg\" width=\"705\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>直到經朋友介紹認識「巨星幫」出身的歌手羅孝勇，二人一拍即合，對方一早已認定她，也很重視其Affa，感情好好，從不介意拍拖要「三人行」，Affa也會稱他為爸爸。2023年王丹妮與羅孝勇低調地拉埋天窗，Affa改為跟羅孝勇姓，由王芷欣改成改名羅芷欣。現時羅孝勇視七歲繼女如己出，做好爸爸角色，同時希望跟王丹妮白頭到老，一家三口生活幸福美滿。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955765519774613_9493468556b0652e8a218c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955765519774613_9493468556b0652e8a218c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557655647058619_10897939706b0652ece4bbb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557655647058619_10897939706b0652ece4bbb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557656288870457_4174621036b0652f40dff2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557656288870457_4174621036b0652f40dff2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557656595433710_4698597826b0652f651d57.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王丹妮 羅孝勇 （圖片來源:IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179557656595433710_4698597826b0652f651d57.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源:IG@l_for_louise）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/4db7d11f-b9ca-452d-bf6b-5eb5040a9205_2551937706195ebf126f72-818x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/4db7d11f-b9ca-452d-bf6b-5eb5040a9205_2551937706195ebf126f72-818x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/f480381c-06d2-4f8f-834c-3df9da388658_2712925136195ebff3fe2c-1024x282.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/f480381c-06d2-4f8f-834c-3df9da388658_2712925136195ebff3fe2c-1024x282.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/e5fdfd4a-0cce-4548-8929-25c0586f2a5b_18542343566195ebf351514-844x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/e5fdfd4a-0cce-4548-8929-25c0586f2a5b_18542343566195ebf351514-844x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/005f4a98-4502-49ee-b8cb-8d166344fb4b_7660295136195ebf5733c4-855x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/005f4a98-4502-49ee-b8cb-8d166344fb4b_7660295136195ebf5733c4-855x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/17fb03ad-6ed4-408d-b723-645718c5c3a6_252468036195ebf75c101-864x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/17fb03ad-6ed4-408d-b723-645718c5c3a6_252468036195ebf75c101-864x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/9ffa5dc1-edc7-4b71-a77a-d4d8dbd43b19_3653200226195ebf94e4a3-853x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/9ffa5dc1-edc7-4b71-a77a-d4d8dbd43b19_3653200226195ebf94e4a3-853x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/55700048-e917-46af-8a74-67b269fdbbfa_4078205536195ebfb71260-874x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/55700048-e917-46af-8a74-67b269fdbbfa_4078205536195ebfb71260-874x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/c7e57704-21e2-48cc-a88c-aa1f17b54d8c_15068239586195ebfd3f2f7-878x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/c7e57704-21e2-48cc-a88c-aa1f17b54d8c_15068239586195ebfd3f2f7-878x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@l_for_louise）\n            </figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:43:57.279989+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1798,"images":18,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T03:16:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T03:37:24.347595+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:37:24.347595+00:00","content_hash":"545a6c92c268d32812367d7502d348d3a73b4642b9f754f75d763a79309cf1b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}